{
  "info": {
    "name": "SmartHelp GenAI \u2014 FastAPI Stochasticity Bias Metrics Logs",
    "description": "Importable Postman collection for the four endpoints shared in the chat. Use the accompanying environment. Requires the FastAPI server and compatible Pydantic schemas. Bias evaluation requires approved policies in MySQL. DELETE is destructive.",
